  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Evan Thomas Spiegel (born June 4, 1990) is an American businessman who is the co-founder and CEO of Snap Inc. Spiegel was the youngest billionaire in the world in 2015. As of August 2025, he had a personal net worth of $2.5 billion according to Forbes.",
